      "r": [
        "Correct. WIfI with revascularisation.",
        "Incorrect. Pulses are absent.",
        "Incorrect. Pressure ulcerates further.",
        "Incorrect. Salvage precedes removal."
      ],
      "kp": "Diabetic ulcers need WIfI plus flow.",
      "source": "IWGDF diabetic foot guidance",
