      "id": "bk2-vas-017",
      "q": "A new dialysis patient with good wrist veins is counselled for access. The first choice is?",
      "o": [
        "No access needed",
        "Radiocephalic fistula with sixes maturation",
        "Femoral catheter forever",
        "Leg vein stripping"
      ],
      "a": 1,
      "exp": "Wrist fistulas last longest, ripening by sixes-rule flow and size with rope-ladder needling preserving sites.",
      "r": [
        "Incorrect. Dialysis needs access.",
        "Correct. Wrist fistula first.",
        "Incorrect. Catheters bridge only.",
        "Incorrect. Arms, not legs, serve."
      ],
      "kp": "Wrist fistula first by sixes.",
      "source": "KDOQI vascular access guidance",
