        "Surgery first always",
        "Antibiotic classes with skin care",
        "Steroids alone"
      ],
      "a": 2,
      "exp": "Each cellulitis scars lymphatics further, so antibiotic classes with entry-lesion care break the cycle.",
      "r": [
        "Incorrect. Bacteria, not fungi, strike.",
        "Incorrect. Wraps precede knives.",
        "Correct. Antibiotics with skin care.",
        "Incorrect. Steroids swell limbs."
      ],
      "kp": "Cellulitis needs antibiotic cover.",
